This product includes support for embedding model artifacts from
sentence-transformers/static-retrieval-mrl-en-v1, an Apache-2.0 licensed
static embedding model published by the Sentence Transformers project.

The static-retrieval-mrl-en-v1 model card identifies Tom Aarsen as the model
author. The model follows the static embedding approach provided through
Sentence Transformers and model2vec.

When redistributing binaries or packages that include ese-generated model
artifacts, preserve applicable copyright, license, and notice information for
ese and for any model artifacts distributed with the downstream package.
